{"step_index":201,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:10:15Z","thinking":"**Constructing Checkout Page**\n\nI'm now building the `/checkout.html` page. The critical first step is displaying a very clear warning message: \"ACADEMIC PAYMENT SIMULATION — No real money will be charged. Do not enter genuine payment information.\" This needs to be prominent to avoid any confusion.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>StreamWave Checkout | Simulated Academic Payment</title>\n\n    <!-- Favicon Links -->\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">\n    <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\">\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/styles.css\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"checkout-body\">\n    <!-- Navbar Header -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"/\" class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Entertainment Home\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"brand-logo-img\">\n            </a>\n\n            <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Primary Navigation\">\n                <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav-link\">Cancel</a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Checkout Container -->\n    <main class=\"checkout-main\">\n        <div class=\"checkout-container\">\n            <!-- Academic Simulation Warning Banner -->\n            <div class=\"simulation-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\">\n                <span class=\"alert-icon\">⚠️</span>\n                <div class=\"alert-text\">\n                    <strong>ACADEMIC PAYMENT SIMULATION</strong>\n                    <p>No real money will be charged. Do not enter genuine payment information.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"checkout-grid\">\n                <!-- Subscription Summary Box -->\n                <div class=\"summary-box\">\n                    <h2 class=\"box-title\">Order Summary</h2>\n                    <div class=\"plan-card\">\n                        <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                            <span class=\"plan-badge\">STUDENT DEMO PLAN</span>\n                            <h3 class=\"plan-name\" id=\"summary-plan-name\">StreamWave Monthly</h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"plan-price\" id=\"summary-plan-price\">US$2.99 <span class=\"price-period\">/ month</span></div>\n                        <ul class=\"plan-benefits-list\">\n                            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">✓</span> Full Zimbabwean movie & music catalogue</li>\n                            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">✓</span> 5-second MP4 movie video previews</li>\n                            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">✓</span> High-fidelity demonstration audio samples</li>\n                            <li><span class=\"check-icon\">✓</span> Cancel anytime online</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Payment Method Form Box -->\n                <div class=\"payment-form-box\">\n                    <h2 class=\"box-title\">Select Payment Option</h2>\n\n                    <form id=\"checkout-form\" onsubmit=\"handlePaymentSubmit(event)\">\n                        <!-- Customer Email Input -->\n                        <div class=\"form-group\">\n                            <label for=\"checkout-email\" class=\"form-label\">Account Email Address</label>\n                            <input type=\"email\" id=\"checkout-email\" class=\"form-input\" placeholder=\"name@example.co.zw\" required>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Payment Method Tabs -->\n                        <div class=\"method-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Payment method choices\">\n                            <button type=\"button\" class=\"method-tab active\" data-method=\"ecocash\" onclick=\"selectMethod('ecocash')\">\n                                <span class=\"method-icon\">📱</span> EcoCash\n                            </button>\n                            <button type=\"button\" class=\"method-tab\" data-method=\"visa\" onclick=\"selectMethod('visa')\">\n                                <span class=\"method-icon\">💳</span> Visa\n                            </button>\n                            <button type=\"button\" class=\"method-tab\" data-method=\"mastercard\" onclick=\"selectMethod('mastercard')\">\n                                <span class=\"method-icon\">💳</span> MasterCard\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- EcoCash Interface Container -->\n                        <div id=\"interface-ecocash\" class=\"method-interface\">\n                            <div class=\"interface-box\">\n                                <span class=\"demo-tag\">Demonstration Mobile Prompt</span>\n                                <label for=\"ecocash-number\" class=\"form-label\">Demonstration Mobile Number</label>\n                                <input type=\"text\" id=\"ecocash-number\" class=\"form-input\" value=\"077 000 0000\" readonly>\n                                <p class=\"help-text\">Simulated EcoCash USSD push request will be dispatched to this test mobile number.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Visa Interface Container -->\n                        <div id=\"interface-visa\" class=\"method-interface\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                            <div class=\"interface-box\">\n                                <span class=\"demo-tag\">Demonstration Card Interface</span>\n                                <div class=\"test-card-preview\">\n                                    <div class=\"card-chip\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-number-display\">•••• •••• •••• 4242</div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-details-row\">\n                                        <span>DEMO HOLDER</span>\n                                        <span>12/28</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"help-text\">Predefined test Visa card (ending in 4242). No CVV or real credentials required.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- MasterCard Interface Container -->\n                        <div id=\"interface-mastercard\" class=\"method-interface\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                            <div class=\"interface-box\">\n                                <span class=\"demo-tag\">Demonstration Card Interface</span>\n                                <div class=\"test-card-preview mastercard-theme\">\n                                    <div class=\"card-chip\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-number-display\">•••• •••• •••• 4444</div>\n                                    <div class=\"card-details-row\">\n                                        <span>DEMO HOLDER</span>\n                                        <span>12/28</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"help-text\">Predefined test MasterCard (ending in 4444). No CVV or real credentials required.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Processing Simulation Status Overlay -->\n                        <div id=\"simulation-status\" class=\"simulation-status-box\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                            <div class=\"status-spinner\"></div>\n                            <div id=\"simulation-step-text\" class=\"simulation-step-text\">Initiating simulated authorization...</div>\n                            <div class=\"progress-bar-track\">\n                                <div id=\"progress-bar-fill\" class=\"progress-bar-fill\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Submit Button -->\n                        <button type=\"submit\" id=\"submit-pay-btn\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-checkout-submit\">\n                            Complete Demo Subscription ($2.99)\n                        </button>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Notice -->\n    <footer class=\"app-footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"footer-logo-img\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"footer-disclaimer\">\n                <strong>Academic Serverless Prototype</strong> • Payment processing is purely simulated for coursework verification. No actual funds will be debited.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        let selectedMethodName = 'ecocash';\n\n        // Pre-fill email from query string if available\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);\n            const emailParam = params.get('email');\n            if (emailParam) {\n                const emailInput = document.getElementById('checkout-email');\n                if (emailInput) emailInput.value = emailParam;\n            }\n        });\n\n        function selectMethod(method) {\n            selectedMethodName = method;\n            document.querySelectorAll('.method-tab').forEach(tab => {\n                const isActive = tab.getAttribute('data-method') === method;\n                tab.classList.toggle('active', isActive);\n            });\n\n            document.getElementById('interface-ecocash').style.display = method === 'ecocash' ? 'block' : 'none';\n            document.getElementById('interface-visa').style.display = method === 'visa' ? 'block' : 'none';\n            document.getElementById('interface-mastercard').style.display = method === 'mastercard' ? 'block' : 'none';\n        }\n\n        async function handlePaymentSubmit(e) {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            const emailInput = document.getElementById('checkout-email');\n            const email = emailInput ? emailInput.value.trim() : '';\n\n            if (!email || !email.includes('@')) {\n                alert('Please enter a valid email address.');\n                return;\n            }\n\n            const btn = document.getElementById('submit-pay-btn');\n            const statusBox = document.getElementById('simulation-status');\n            const stepText = document.getElementById('simulation-step-text');\n            const progressFill = document.getElementById('progress-bar-fill');\n\n            btn.disabled = true;\n            statusBox.style.display = 'block';\n\n            // Step Sequence Simulation\n            const steps = selectedMethodName === 'ecocash'\n                ? [\n                    { msg: '📱 Sending USSD push request to EcoCash...', pct: '30%' },\n                    { msg: '⏳ Waiting for simulated mobile PIN approval...', pct: '70%' },\n                    { msg: '✅ EcoCash payment approved! Authorizing session...', pct: '100%' }\n                ]\n                : [\n                    { msg: '💳 Validating test card details...', pct: '35%' },\n                    { msg: '🔒 Authorizing simulated transaction...', pct: '75%' },\n                    { msg: '✅ Payment approved! Creating member session...', pct: '100%' }\n                ];\n\n            // Execute visual step animation\n            for (let i = 0; i < steps.length; i++) {\n                stepText.textContent = steps[i].msg;\n                progressFill.style.width = steps[i].pct;\n                await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 600));\n            }\n\n            // Send ONLY email, method, and plan_id to backend (Never send card/mobile inputs)\n            try {\n                const res = await fetch('/api/demo-payment', {\n                    method: 'POST',\n                    headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n                    body: JSON.stringify({\n                        email: email,\n                        method: selectedMethodName,\n                        plan_id: 'streamwave-monthly'\n                    })\n                });\n\n                if (res.ok) {\n                    const data = await res.json();\n                    window.location.href = data.redirect_url || '/library';\n                } else {\n                    const err = await res.json();\n                    alert(err.detail || 'Payment simulation failed.');\n                    btn.disabled = false;\n                    statusBox.style.display = 'none';\n                }\n            } catch (err) {\n                console.error('Checkout error:', err);\n                alert('Connection error during simulation.');\n                btn.disabled = false;\n                statusBox.style.display = 'none';\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Create checkout.html for EcoCash, Visa, and MasterCard academic payment simulation","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\public\\checkout.html","toolAction":"Creating checkout.html","toolSummary":"Creating checkout.html"}}]}
