{"step_index":203,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T19:10:37Z","thinking":"**Constructing Library Page**\n\nOkay, I'm now focused on building the `/library.html` file. The primary concern is session management. I'll need to use `GET /api/session` to verify active, paid membership status. If the session indicates a free user, redirection to `/` or `/checkout` is the next step. Then the catalogue will load.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>StreamWave Member Library | Catalogue & Player</title>\n    \n    <!-- Favicon Links -->\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">\n    <link rel=\"shortcut icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\">\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/images/favicon.png\">\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/css/styles.css\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"library-body\">\n    <!-- Header Navigation Bar -->\n    <header class=\"navbar\">\n        <div class=\"nav-container\">\n            <a href=\"/library\" class=\"brand\" aria-label=\"StreamWave Entertainment Home\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"brand-logo-img\">\n            </a>\n\n            <nav class=\"nav-links\" aria-label=\"Primary Navigation\">\n                <a href=\"#featured\" class=\"nav-link active\">Home</a>\n                <a href=\"#catalogue\" class=\"nav-link\">Catalogue</a>\n                <a href=\"/docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"nav-link developer-link\" title=\"Open API Documentation\">\n                    Developer API <span class=\"ext-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span>\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Member Session Status & Sign Out Controls -->\n            <div class=\"member-nav-controls\">\n                <div class=\"member-badge\" id=\"member-badge-display\">\n                    <span class=\"pulse-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                    <span id=\"member-email-text\">Demo Member</span>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.resetDemoSession()\" title=\"Reset demonstration session for assessment\">\n                    Reset Demo\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.signOut()\">\n                    Sign Out\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"main-content\">\n        <!-- Hero / Featured Content Section -->\n        <section id=\"featured\" class=\"hero-section\" aria-label=\"Featured Media Release\">\n            <div class=\"hero-backdrop\"></div>\n            <div class=\"hero-content\">\n                <div class=\"hero-tag-group\">\n                    <span class=\"hero-tag\">FEATURED ZIMBABWEAN RELEASE</span>\n                    <span class=\"tech-sample-pill\">5-second technical preview</span>\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"hero-title\" title=\"Cook Off (2017)\">Cook Off</h1>\n                <p class=\"hero-meta\">\n                    <span class=\"meta-tag\">Movie</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>2017</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>Comedy / Romance</span>\n                    <span class=\"meta-separator\">•</span>\n                    <span>1h 41m</span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"hero-description\">\n                    An uplifting Zimbabwean romantic comedy following Anesu, a single mother in Harare who enters a high-stakes national cooking competition against all odds.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.playMoviePreview('1', this)\">\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▶</span> Watch\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.openDetails('1', this)\">\n                        <span class=\"btn-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">ℹ</span> View Details\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Catalogue Filter & Search Section -->\n        <section id=\"catalogue\" class=\"catalogue-section\" aria-label=\"Media Catalogue\">\n            <div class=\"section-header\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Media Catalogue</h2>\n                <span class=\"item-count\" id=\"item-count\">Loading...</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Controls Toolbar -->\n            <div class=\"toolbar\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Catalogue Search and Filtering Controls\">\n                <div class=\"search-box\">\n                    <span class=\"search-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</span>\n                    <input type=\"text\" id=\"search-input\" placeholder=\"Search title, artist, director, or genre...\" aria-label=\"Search media catalogue\">\n                    <button id=\"clear-search\" class=\"clear-btn\" aria-label=\"Clear search query\" style=\"display: none;\">✕</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"filter-group\">\n                    <!-- Type Filter Tabs -->\n                    <div class=\"type-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Filter media by type\">\n                        <button class=\"type-tab active\" data-type=\"\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">All</button>\n                        <button class=\"type-tab\" data-type=\"movie\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Movies</button>\n                        <button class=\"type-tab\" data-type=\"music\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\">Music</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Genre Dropdown -->\n                    <div class=\"select-wrapper\">\n                        <select id=\"genre-select\" aria-label=\"Filter media by genre\">\n                            <option value=\"\">All Genres</option>\n                            <option value=\"Comedy\">Comedy</option>\n                            <option value=\"Drama\">Drama</option>\n                            <option value=\"Action\">Action</option>\n                            <option value=\"Zimdancehall\">Zimdancehall</option>\n                            <option value=\"Afro-pop\">Afro-pop</option>\n                            <option value=\"Traditional\">Traditional</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- UI States Container -->\n            <div id=\"state-container\">\n                <!-- Loading State -->\n                <div id=\"loading-state\" class=\"state-view\">\n                    <div class=\"spinner\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Loading content\"></div>\n                    <p>Loading Zimbabwean media catalogue...</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Error State -->\n                <div id=\"error-state\" class=\"state-view\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"state-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚠️</div>\n                    <h3>Failed to Load Media</h3>\n                    <p id=\"error-message\">Unable to fetch media catalogue from serverless backend.</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.fetchMedia()\">Try Again</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Empty State -->\n                <div id=\"empty-state\" class=\"state-view\" style=\"display: none;\">\n                    <div class=\"state-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🔍</div>\n                    <h3>No Media Found</h3>\n                    <p>No titles match your current search and filter criteria.</p>\n                    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" onclick=\"window.streamWaveApp.resetFilters()\">Reset Filters</button>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Media Cards Grid -->\n                <div id=\"media-grid\" class=\"media-grid\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer Statement -->\n    <footer class=\"app-footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n                <img src=\"/images/streamwave-logo.png\" alt=\"StreamWave Entertainment Logo\" class=\"footer-logo-img\">\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"footer-disclaimer\">\n                <strong>Academic Serverless Prototype</strong> • Built with Python 3.12, FastAPI, and Vercel Serverless Functions.\n                Movie previews use an original 5-second StreamWave MP4 video. Audio playback relies on an original synthesized demonstration chime. No copyrighted commercial files are hosted or transmitted.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <!-- Accessible Media Details Modal Dialog -->\n    <dialog id=\"details-dialog\" class=\"details-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dialog-title\" aria-describedby=\"dialog-desc\">\n        <div class=\"dialog-content\">\n            <button id=\"close-dialog\" class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close details modal\">✕</button>\n            <div id=\"dialog-body\" class=\"dialog-body\">\n                <!-- Dynamic Content Injected via JS -->\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </dialog>\n\n    <!-- Professional Dedicated Video Player Modal Dialog -->\n    <dialog id=\"video-dialog\" class=\"video-dialog\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"video-modal-title\">\n        <div class=\"video-dialog-content\">\n            <button id=\"close-video-x\" class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close video preview modal\">✕</button>\n            <div class=\"video-modal-header\">\n                <div class=\"video-header-top\">\n                    <span class=\"meta-tag\">Movie Preview</span>\n                    <span class=\"tech-sample-pill\">5-second technical preview</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 id=\"video-modal-title\" class=\"video-modal-title\">Movie Title</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"video-wrapper\">\n                <video id=\"html5-video\" controls playsinline preload=\"metadata\">\n                    <source id=\"video-source\" src=\"/media/streamwave-preview.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n                    Your browser does not support HTML5 video playback.\n                </video>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"video-modal-footer\">\n                <button id=\"video-replay-btn\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: none;\" aria-label=\"Replay video preview\">\n                    🔄 Replay\n                </button>\n                <button id=\"close-video-btn\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" aria-label=\"Close video player modal\">\n                    Close\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </dialog>\n\n    <!-